This file intentionally starts without a metadata block.

Open it with `"plumb lsp", place the cursor in this first block, and request code
actions. The server should offer `"Insert document metadata" and prepend a
direct document metadata whose title is `"metadata-scratch" and whose created value is the
current local RFC 3339 timestamp.

`# After trying the action

The beginning of the file should have this shape:

`plumb"
  {
    `= title metadata-scratch
    `= created `"2026-07-20T12:34:56+08:00"
  }

Return to the `->[playground index|index.plumb].
